    rdf:value """Bernhard’s are:
Obrist
Mr. Benn
Miss Rea  (less)
Miss Puffer 
Miss Buttles 
The Perrys  (ended)
Henry Farrer
Mr. Davis  (less)
George Carpenter
Klinsmann
Mr. Bywater
Frizzoni
Sir Charles Turner  (less)
Mine are:
Evelyne Nordhoff  (best of all)
Mr. Burke  [ended Feb. 1 96]
Eva McLaren
“ Puck”  (died out)
Mr. Britten
Gertrude Burton  (died Jan. 26)
Edith Thomas
Mr. Zangwill  (stayed too long)
Isabel Fry
Saidie Nordhoff 
Mrs. Mosher 
Dr. Bucke
Rukhmabai
Florence Dike """^^xsd:string ;
